WEBVTT

00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:02.992
<v><b>Marta:</b></v> This happened two years ago.

00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:09.891
I’m Spanish, but I was in Ireland at the time because I had a job in Dublin.

00:00:10.963 --> 00:00:16.556
Some friends of mine who lived in Lyon, in France, invited me to come and stay,

00:00:17.233 --> 00:00:24.088
so I decided to have a short holiday, a long weekend, from Friday to Tuesday.

00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:29.802
I looked for cheap flights, but I couldn’t find any direct ones.

00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:35.664
The only thing I could find was Ryanair from Dublin to Brussels,

00:00:36.048 --> 00:00:39.077
and then Air France from Brussels to Lyon.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:43.110
Anyway, the flight to Brussels was fine,

00:00:43.721 --> 00:00:48.245
and when I arrived, I went to the gate for my next flight to Lyon,

00:00:48.927 --> 00:00:55.822
but, then when I needed to show my boarding pass and my ID, I couldn’t find my ID card.

00:00:56.684 --> 00:01:02.734
I looked everywhere – in my bag, in my case – but it wasn’t there.

00:01:03.835 --> 00:01:08.607
The people at the gate were very nice and they made some phone calls,

00:01:08.975 --> 00:01:10.639
but nobody could find it.

00:01:11.552 --> 00:01:17.278
So they told me to wait in a small room and I sat there for more than an hour,

00:01:17.953 --> 00:01:20.829
and my flight to Lyon left without me.

00:01:22.023 --> 00:01:28.432
It was awful – I cried – I was so stressed and unhappy.

00:01:29.473 --> 00:01:34.601
In the end, a policeman came and he said that I couldn’t go to France

00:01:34.705 --> 00:01:37.206
because I didn’t have any ID –

00:01:38.087 --> 00:01:43.150
the only place I could go was to Spain to get a new ID card!

00:01:44.094 --> 00:01:50.556
I waited another five or six hours for the flight to Madrid, feeling very depressed.

00:01:51.606 --> 00:01:53.803
So I never had my holiday!

00:01:54.516 --> 00:01:58.816
I spent the weekend in Madrid getting my new ID card!